实现方式。按钮不是实际创建出来的，而是实时绘制出来的，所以轻量级。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"ZvtfC\" id=\"ZvtfC\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15a6c622\" id=\"u15a6c622\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">1.常用方法</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uff875978\" id=\"uff875978\"><span data-lake-id=\"u272e2edf\" id=\"u272e2edf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">创建按钮矩阵:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lv_obj_t%20*%20lv_btnmatrix_create(lv_obj_t%20*%20parent)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hHKYD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u35ab6e8d\" id=\"u35ab6e8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc49c6071\" id=\"uc49c6071\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">设置字符串数组:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_btnmatrix_set_map(lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20const%20char%20*%20map%5B%5D)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IphfV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uf6f12877\" id=\"uf6f12877\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7e485008\" id=\"u7e485008\"><span data-lake-id=\"u820c4907\" id=\"u820c4907\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1:btnma